      "depict": {
        "id": "depict",
        "kind": "composite",
        "status": "implemented",
        "title": "Depict as an image",
        "description": "Express a text content as an image: a chat model first writes an image prompt that depicts the text (in the style given), then the image model paints it (the openai_images adapter). Needs an image model and the provider that serves it: arguments model and provider, or the settings image_model and image_provider.",
        "why": {
          "pl": "Przedstawia tekst obrazem: model rozmowy pisze opis obrazu, potem model obrazów go maluje."
        },
        "labels": {
          "pl": "Przedstaw obrazem"
        },
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "scene",
            "action": "use_model",
            "with": {
              "system": {
                "$localized": {
                  "en": "You write prompts for an image generator. Describe ONE concrete scene that depicts the text: subject, setting, composition, lighting, mood and the requested style. At most 120 words. Output only the prompt, in English.",
                  "pl": "Piszesz prompty dla generatora obrazów. Opisz JEDNĄ konkretną scenę przedstawiającą tekst: temat, miejsce, kompozycję, światło, nastrój i zadany styl. Najwyżej 120 słów. Podaj sam prompt, po angielsku."
                }
              },
              "prompt": {
                "$format": {
                  "$localized": {
                    "en": "Write an image prompt that depicts the text above. Style: {style}.",
                    "pl": "Napisz prompt obrazu przedstawiający powyższy tekst. Styl: {style}."
                  }
                },
                "vars": {
                  "style": {
                    "$arg": "style",
                    "default": "a clear, detailed illustration"
                  }
                }
              },
              "parameters": {
                "temperature": 0.7
              }
            },
            "estimate": {
              "output_tokens": {
                "low": 40,
                "high": 300
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "paint",
            "action": "use_model",
            "with": {
              "model": {
                "$arg": "model"
              },
              "provider": {
                "$arg": "provider"
              },
              "wants": [
                "image"
              ],
              "parameters": {
                "n": 1,
                "size": {
                  "$arg": "size",
                  "default": "1024x1024"
                },
                "response_format": "b64_json"
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "inputs": [
          "text"
        ],
        "outputs": [
          "text",
          "image"
        ],
        "requires": [
          "has_text"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "image_form"
        ],
        "content_op": "preserve",
        "form_op": "express",
        "cost": 3.0,
        "confidence": 0.6,
        "effects": {
          "reads_only": false,
          "writes": true,
          "sends_off_device": true,
          "costs_money": true,
          "irreversible": false,
          "touches_private_data": true
        },
        "consumer": "",
        "phrases": {
          "en": [
            "draw",
            "paint",
            "depict",
            "make image",
            "make picture",
            "create image",
            "generate image",
            "turn image"
          ],
          "pl": [
            "narysuj*",
            "namaluj*",
            "zrób obraz*",
            "zrób rysunek",
            "wygeneruj obraz*",
            "stwórz obraz*",
            "przedstaw*"
          ]
        },
        "params": [
          {
            "name": "model",
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "setting": "image_model",
            "description": {
              "en": "The image model.",
              "pl": "Model obrazów."
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "provider",
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "setting": "image_provider",
            "description": {
              "en": "The provider (manifest id, adapter openai_images) that serves the image model.",
              "pl": "Dostawca (id manifestu, adapter openai_images) obsługujący model obrazów."
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "style",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "default": "a clear, detailed illustration",
            "description": {
              "en": "The style of the image (\"watercolour\", \"pixel art\").",
              "pl": "Styl obrazu („akwarela”, „pixel art”)."
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "size",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "default": "1024x1024",
            "description": {
              "en": "Image size as the provider names it.",
              "pl": "Rozmiar obrazu w nazwach dostawcy."
            }
          }
        ],
        "examples": {
          "en": [
            "draw this conversation"
          ],
          "pl": [
            "narysuj tę rozmowę"
          ]
        },
        "default_element": "current_conversation",
        "human": {
          "title": {
            "pl": "Przedstaw obrazem",
            "en": "Depict as an image"
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "label": {
                "pl": "„Model dla działania” (Twój wybór albo wybór tej rozmowy), inaczej Twój „Model rozmowy” z ustawień (nie model wybrany dla tej rozmowy), pisze prompt obrazu w zadanym stylu",
                "en": "“Model for an action” (your choice or this conversation’s), otherwise your “Conversation model” from the settings (not the model chosen for this conversation), writes an image prompt in the given style"
              },
              "uses_role": "action.*"
            },
            {
              "label": {
                "pl": "Model z polecenia, inaczej „Model obrazów” (image_model; dostawca z polecenia, inaczej „Dostawca obrazów”, image_provider) maluje obraz",
                "en": "The model from the command, else “Image model” (image_model; the provider from the command, else “Image provider”, image_provider) paints the image"
              },
              "uses_role": "image.generate"
            }
          ],
          "steps_are": "description"
        },
        "reads": [
          "default_model",
          "image_model",
          "image_provider"
        ],
        "uses_role": "image.generate",
        "implemented_in": [
          "loom/data/runtime/actions.pack#/defaults/actions/depict",
          "loom/data/runtime/action_run.pack#/defaults/use_model"
        ]
      },
      "narrate": {
        "id": "narrate",
        "kind": "composite",
        "status": "implemented",
        "title": "Narrate aloud",
        "description": "Express a text content as speech: first the text is rewritten as a narration for reading aloud (text), then, when a speech model is set (argument or setting speech_model, with speech_provider), that narration is spoken (audio). Without a speech model the result is the narration text; no speech adapter is registered by default.",
        "why": {
          "pl": "Przedstawia tekst głosem: najpierw narracja do czytania na głos, potem — gdy jest model mowy — nagranie."
        },
        "labels": {
          "pl": "Opowiedz na głos"
        },
        "steps": [
          {
            "id": "script",
            "action": "use_model",
            "with": {
              "system": {
                "$localized": {
                  "en": "You prepare texts for reading aloud. Rewrite the text as a spoken narration: short sentences, no markup or lists, numbers and abbreviations written out in words, a clear rhythm. Keep the meaning and the language. Output only the narration.",
                  "pl": "Przygotowujesz teksty do czytania na głos. Przepisz tekst jako narrację mówioną: krótkie zdania, bez znaczników i list, liczby i skróty zapisane słowami, wyraźny rytm. Zachowaj sens i język. Podaj samą narrację."
                }
              },
              "prompt": {
                "$format": {
                  "$localized": {
                    "en": "Prepare the text above for narration. Tone: {tone}.",
                    "pl": "Przygotuj powyższy tekst do narracji. Ton: {tone}."
                  }
                },
                "vars": {
                  "tone": {
                    "$arg": "tone",
                    "default": {
                      "$localized": {
                        "en": "calm and clear",
                        "pl": "spokojny i wyraźny"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "parameters": {
                "temperature": 0.5
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "speak",
            "action": "use_model",
            "when": {
              "arg": "speech_model"
            },
            "with": {
              "model": {
                "$arg": "speech_model"
              },
              "provider": {
                "$arg": "speech_provider",
                "default": ""
              },
              "wants": [
                "audio"
              ],
              "parameters": {
                "$arg": "speech_parameters",
                "default": {}
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "inputs": [
          "text"
        ],
        "outputs": [
          "text",
          "audio"
        ],
        "requires": [
          "has_text"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "audio_form"
        ],
        "content_op": "preserve",
        "form_op": "express",
        "cost": 1.0,
        "confidence": 0.8,
        "effects": {
          "reads_only": false,
          "writes": true,
          "sends_off_device": true,
          "costs_money": true,
          "irreversible": false,
          "touches_private_data": true
        },
        "consumer": "",
        "phrases": {
          "en": [
            "read aloud",
            "read out",
            "narrate"
          ],
          "pl": [
            "przeczytaj na głos",
            "przeczytaj naglos",
            "opowiedz*",
            "narracj*"
          ]
        },
        "params": [
          {
            "name": "tone",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "default": "calm and clear",
            "description": {
              "en": "Tone of the narration.",
              "pl": "Ton narracji."
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "speech_model",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "setting": "speech_model",
            "description": {
              "en": "A model that speaks (needs an adapter that produces audio). Without it the result is the narration text.",
              "pl": "Model, który mówi (wymaga adaptera dającego dźwięk). Bez niego wynikiem jest tekst narracji."
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "speech_provider",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "setting": "speech_provider",
            "description": {
              "en": "The provider (manifest id) of the speech model.",
              "pl": "Dostawca (id manifestu) modelu mowy."
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "speech_parameters",
            "type": "object",
            "required": false,
            "description": {
              "en": "Extra parameters of the speech request (voice, format ...), as the provider names them.",
              "pl": "Dodatkowe parametry żądania mowy (głos, format ...) w nazwach dostawcy."
            }
          }
        ],
        "examples": {
          "en": [
            "read this message aloud"
          ],
          "pl": [
            "przeczytaj tę wiadomość na głos"
          ]
        },
        "human": {
          "title": {
            "pl": "Opowiedz na głos",
            "en": "Narrate aloud"
          },
          "steps": [
            {
              "label": {
                "pl": "„Model dla działania” (Twój wybór albo wybór tej rozmowy), inaczej Twój „Model rozmowy” z ustawień (nie model wybrany dla tej rozmowy), przepisuje tekst jako narrację do czytania na głos",
                "en": "“Model for an action” (your choice or this conversation’s), otherwise your “Conversation model” from the settings (not the model chosen for this conversation), rewrites the text as a narration for reading aloud"
              },
              "uses_role": "action.*"
            },
            {
              "label": {
                "pl": "Gdy jest model mowy (z polecenia, inaczej „Model mowy”, speech_model; dostawca: „Dostawca mowy”, speech_provider): wypowiedz narrację; bez niego wynikiem jest tekst",
                "en": "When a speech model is set (from the command, else “Speech model”, speech_model; provider: “Speech provider”, speech_provider): speak the narration; without it the result is the text"
              },
              "uses_role": "speech.synthesize"
            }
          ],
          "steps_are": "description"
        },
        "reads": [
          "default_model",
          "speech_model",
          "speech_provider"
        ],
        "uses_role": "speech.synthesize",
        "implemented_in": [
          "loom/data/runtime/actions.pack#/defaults/actions/narrate",
          "loom/data/runtime/action_run.pack#/defaults/use_model"
        ]
      },
      "actions.for": {
        "id": "actions.for",
        "kind": "atomic",
        "status": "implemented",
        "title": "Actions that fit an element",
        "description": "Which actions fit the element: traits it has against the traits each action requires, then the rules of the scope. Each row: status (applicable, needs_confirmation, denied with reason, default) and the explanation.",
        "why": {
          "pl": "Mówi, które działania pasują do elementu i co o nich mówią reguły."
        },
        "labels": {
          "pl": "Akcje pasujące do elementu"
        },
        "inputs": [
          "json"
        ],
        "outputs": [
          "json"
        ],
        "requires": [
          "application"
        ],
        "produces": [],
        "content_op": "none",
        "form_op": "none",
        "cost": 0.0,
        "confidence": 1.0,
        "effects": {
          "reads_only": true,
          "writes": false,
          "sends_off_device": false,
          "costs_money": false,
          "irreversible": false,
          "touches_private_data": false
        },
        "consumer": "loom/src/actions/action_rules.cpp",
        "port": "actions",
        "action": "for",
        "params": [
          {
            "name": "element",
            "type": "object",
            "required": true,
            "description": {
              "en": "The element: {\"class\": class id, \"traits\": [extra traits], \"attrs\": {...}, \"id\": optional}",
              "pl": "Element: {\"class\": id klasy, \"traits\": [dodatkowe cechy], \"attrs\": {...}, \"id\": opcjonalnie}"
            },
            "has_default": false,
            "edit": "json"
          },
          {
            "name": "scope",
            "type": "string",
            "required": false,
            "description": {
              "en": "Scope level of the scopes chain, or an object {level: instance id}; default: the most specific level",
              "pl": "Poziom łańcucha zakresów albo obiekt {poziom: id}; domyślnie najbardziej szczegółowy"
            },
            "has_default": false,
            "edit": "free_text"
          },
          {
            "name": "include_unmatched",
            "type": "boolean",
            "required": false,
            "description": {
