        "description": "Answers the question a run is paused on (a proposal, a confirmation the rules ask for, or the usage guard's x10 hold). The receipt must be the pending one (pending.receipt_id); a stale or invented receipt is refused. approved: true continues the run, false drops it (and records the refusal with the usage guard).",
