      "guardian.promote": {
        "id": "guardian.promote",
        "kind": "atomic",
        "status": "implemented",
        "title": "Remember it as a rule",
        "description": "Promotes a hypothesis of the context guardian: a correction becomes a rule written to the user overlay profiles/guardian.pack, a run of clarifications becomes one compiled instruction (the existing active task specification). Either way the conversation's chat_representation is set to guardian by a rule of that conversation, so later sends use the representation. The raw messages are never touched. Undo: guardian.undo.",
        "why": {
          "pl": "Zamienia hipotezę strażnika w regułę albo w jedno skompilowane polecenie."
        },
        "labels": {
