        "description": "The levels L0-L3 of a message or of a conversation: for each level the text the context selector could send in place of the raw one and what was dropped (category, span, producer), with the segment annotations of every producer. refresh rebuilds the levels from the annotations (an analyzer's annotations are applied too). The raw text is never touched; guardian.undo with an annotation id takes one drop back.",
