      "roles.resolved": {
        "id": "roles.resolved",
        "kind": "atomic",
        "status": "implemented",
        "title": "Who does which job",
        "description": "Every model role: its name and why, the policy chain step by step with what each step reads today, the model it resolves to (the same function every reader calls), the class with its reason, the flow of that class for the roles whose readers use it, the background mode where the data names one, the cost (registry price per million or why it is unknown; the last 7 days are unknown because the ledger records actions, not roles) and the flows that use the role. Read only.",
        "why": {
          "pl": "Każda rola modelu: po co jest, który model ją wykonuje i dlaczego, ile to kosztuje."
        },
        "labels": {
